cfg.colored_shulkers.enableDrops=Colored Shulker Shell Drops
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableDrops.tooltip=When a Shulker is killed, it drops a Shulker Shell based on that Shulker's color.\n§7§lTip:§r§r§7 You can use the §o/reload§r§r§7 command to reload loot tables. This will apply any changes made to this config setting without the need to restart your game!
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableEndCity=Colored Shulker Spawning (End City)
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableEndCity.tooltip=Colored Shulkers have a chance to appear instead of colorless Shulkers when generated by an End City.\nThe weights of specific colors have their own dedicated settings, and may be configured below.
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableSpawner=Colored Shulker Spawning (Monster Spawner)
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableSpawner.tooltip=Colored Shulkers have a chance to appear instead of colorless Shulkers when created by a Monster Spawner.\nThe weights of specific colors have their own dedicated settings, and may be configured below.
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableWorld=Colored Shulker Spawning (Natural)
cfg.colored_shulkers.enableWorld.tooltip=Colored Shulkers have a chance to appear instead of colorless Shulkers when spawned naturally by the world.\nThe weights of specific colors have their own dedicated settings, and may be configured below.
cfg.colored_shulkers.endCityBeetrootSoupChance=End City Beetroot Soup Chance
cfg.colored_shulkers.endCityBeetrootSoupChance.tooltip=The probability of one Beetroot Soup item generating inside of an End City loot chest.\nThis setting exists as a Vanilla-friendly way of allowing bowls to be obtainable in the End, which are needed in the crafting recipe to create dyes from colored Shulker Shells.\n§7§lTip:§r§r§7 You can use the §o/reload§r§r§7 command to reload loot tables. This will apply any changes made to this config setting without the need to restart your game!
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDying=Shulker Dying
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDying.tooltip=Shulkers and Shulker Boxes may be dyed or washed with certain items by right-clicking.
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDyingFX=Shulker Dying Visual Effects
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDyingFX.tooltip=Dying a Shulker or Shulker Box plays similar effects to shearing a Mooshroom.
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDyingNoDrops=Shulker Dying Prevents Drops
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDyingNoDrops.tooltip=Dying a Shulker will stop that Shulker from dropping Shulker Shells. Any loot added by other mods will continue to drop.\nUseful if you want to allow Shulker dying, while only allowing colored Shulker Shells to be obtainable from Shulkers that generated in the color.
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDyingWithDyes=Shulker Dying With Dyes
cfg.colored_shulkers.inWorldDyingWithDyes.tooltip=Shulkers and Shulker Boxes may be dyed by right-clicking with any Forge-recognized dye item.\nIf this is disabled, they are still dyeable with Shulker Shells.
cfg.colored_shulkers.rainbowShellBreaking=Rainbow Shulker Shell Shattering
cfg.colored_shulkers.rainbowShellBreaking.tooltip=Rainbow Shulker may be shattered into XP and Shulker Shells by right-clicking.\nSpecific items or conditions may be added or removed by editing the "colored_shulkers:rainbow_shell_shatter" loot table (by using the GroovyScript mod, or something similar).
cfg.colored_shulkers.rainbowShellXP=Rainbow Shulker Shell Shattering XP
cfg.colored_shulkers.rainbowShellXP.tooltip=The amount of XP gained by shattering a Rainbow Shulker Shell. Set to 0 to disable.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellColorInTooltip=Shulker Shell Color In Tooltip
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellColorInTooltip.tooltip=Add the color of the Shulker Shell to the item tooltip, rather than to the item name.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellDyingRecipes=Shulker Shell Dying Recipes
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellDyingRecipes.tooltip=Add crafting recipes for making colored Shulker Shells by using any Shulker Shell with a Forge-recognized dye item.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellToDyeBreaking=Shulker Shell Dye Amount (From Shattering)
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellToDyeBreaking.tooltip=The amount of dye that's yielded by shattering a colored Shulker Shell. Set to 0 to disable.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellToDyeBreakingXP=Shulker Shell Shattering XP
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellToDyeBreakingXP.tooltip=The amount of XP gained by shattering a colored Shulker Shell. Set to 0 to disable.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellToDyeRecipes=Shulker Shell Dye Amount (From Recipes)
cfg.colored_shulkers.shellToDyeRecipes.tooltip=The amount of dye that's yielded by placing a colored Shulker Shell and a Bowl in a crafting table, or by grinding up a colored Shulker Shell in a supported modded grinder block. Set to 0 to disable.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shulkerChanceRainbow=Rainbow Shulker Probability
cfg.colored_shulkers.shulkerChanceRainbow.tooltip=The probability of generating a Rainbow Shulker. Set to 0 to disable.
cfg.colored_shulkers.shulkerWeightColorless=Colored Shulker Weight (Colorless)
cfg.colored_shulkers.shulkerWeightColorless.tooltip=The weight of a colorless shulker. A higher value means a higher chance of spawning when compared to other colors.
